# TypeScript's incremental-build caches: machine-specific, and rewritten by every
# `npm run build`, so committing them meant a dirty tree after any UI build.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
# Node build deps for any package-shipped web bundle (e.g. src/robovast_nav/web,
# the run-view panel remotes). Their built output lands elsewhere as package data.
**/node_modules
# Built Module-Federation panel bundle (package data). Generated by the web/ project's
# `npm run build`; the wheel build must run it (like ui/dist), so it is not committed.
src/robovast_nav/robovast_nav/web/dist
# @module-federation/vite's build-time scratch dir (diagnostics), written next to the sources.
**/.mf
.env
